Error [E0905]: `P` isn't `Shape`
  --> tests/ui/generic_bound_forward_missing.jet:9:32
    |
  9 | fn outer<P>(shape: P) -> Int { inner<P>(shape) }
    |                                ^^^^^
 Why: Type parameter `P` doesn't declare the `Shape` bound, so a caller may choose a type without it
 Fix: Declare the bound where `P` is introduced: `<P: Shape>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0905
